Description: Pivuan boot splash (plymouth theme)
 The Pivuan logo on a black screen while the system starts and shuts down.
 At boot a band of light sweeps over the logo and it brightens, then sparks
 of electricity run along the logo's three circuit traces to their rings
 until the boot is done. There is no spinner or progress bar.
